# Tests — `test/helpers`

## Role

- Verify view helpers: formatting, URL generation, escaped HTML fragments, display predicates.

## Strategy

- Include the helper in the project’s helper test case; call methods with minimal arguments without an HTTP cycle.
- No DB unless unavoidable; prefer stubs.
- For HTML: assert safety and presence of expected markup; avoid huge snapshot strings.
